# PumpController Supporting FBs

## 1. PumpTimer_FB_ST
Purpose: Limit pump run time to avoid dry run.
Inputs: Cycle_Active, Stage_Ready
Outputs: PumpTimer_Done
Logic: TON timer instance, starts when Stage_Ready is TRUE.

## 2. PumpAlarm_FB_ST
Purpose: Raise alarm if pump runs but level doesn’t change.
Inputs: Pump_Discharge, Tn_Level_Low
Outputs: Pump_Alarm
Logic: IF Pump_Discharge AND NOT Tn_Level_Low after timeout THEN Pump_Alarm := TRUE.

## 3. PumpInterlock_FB_ST
Purpose: Prevent pump from running if heater is ON.
Inputs: Heater
Outputs: Pump_Enable
Logic: Pump_Enable := NOT(Heater).
